Connected TV spend in the Columbus region (region code CMH) in 2024 was $478,223.11. That is the sum of 16 weekly rows, counting each week by its Monday.

CTV runs in flights, so Columbus has spend only in late March to early May and again from late July to mid September 2024. The data has no other 2024 weeks for Columbus.

