Non-brand paid search had a cost per click of about $9.00 in Q2 2024.

I used the `FH_Search_NonBrand` campaign in the Google Ads weekly data. I counted the 13 weeks whose Monday falls in Q2, which run from 2024-04-01 to 2024-06-24. Spend was $3,653,028.57 on 406,086 clicks, which works out to $8.9957 per click.

