Meta reported 165,300 conversions on its own platform in 2025. That is the sum of `leads` in `ads_meta_weekly` for weeks starting 2025-01-06 through 2025-12-22. Each week is assigned to the year of its Monday, and the 2025 weeks cover 20 regions.

The Meta export has no column called "conversions". Its only conversion-type metric is `leads`, so I treated that as Meta's platform-reported conversions. If you define a Meta conversion some other way, this number would change.

