Fernhook created $220,204,440 in pipeline in 2023. That is the sum of `amount` across 81,650 opportunities in `crm_opportunities` with a `created_date` in calendar 2023.

The sum covers every stage (Closed Won, Closed Lost and Open), because pipeline created counts an opportunity when it is opened, whatever happened to it later. I found no duplicate opportunity IDs and no null or non-positive amounts. I used the calendar year of each opportunity's own creation date, not the week-to-Monday rule, since the opportunity data is daily.

