The Upper Midwest sales area had 5,019 closed-won deals in 2025.

I counted opportunities with stage "Closed Won" and a close date in 2025. I assigned each one to a sales area through its lead's region code. The Upper Midwest regions are MSP, RST, DLH, FAR and FSD. All 25,163 closed-won deals from 2025 matched a lead, and none were duplicated.

