The data doesn't say which channels have the "performance" role. The tables list channels such as paid search brand and non-brand, YouTube, display, Meta, LinkedIn, CTV, and affiliates. Nothing maps those channels to roles like brand, performance, or awareness. The media plan notes only hint at roles, for example "brand programs trimmed, search protected". That isn't a definition, so any split I made would be a guess.

If you give me the list of channels you count as performance-role, I can calculate the 2023 share.

